X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T150000
LOCATION:Shone Farm
SUMMARY:Shone Farm Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season at SRJC Shone Farm's Fall Festival.  Joi
 n us for a fun-filled day at the farm featuringU-Pick pumpkins\, sweet po
 tatoes\, apples and corn  Tractor hayrides  Barn animal meet-and-greets  
 Children's activities  Face painting  Pedal tractors  Free family photos 
  An organic farmstand  Local food vendors    and more!  Admission is $5 p
 er person ages 2 and up. The event is cashless\, and tickets can be purch
 ased in advance or at the gate. Guests are encouraged to bring their own 
 wagon for U-Pick activities. Please note that pets are not permitted\, wi
 th the exception of service animals.For more information and tickets\, vi
 sit the Fall Festival website here. (https://shonefarm.santarosa.edu/shon
 e-farm-fall-festival)  &#160\;Shone Farm - 7450 Steve Olson Lane\, Forest
 ville\, CA
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Celebrate the season at SRJC Shone Farm
 's Fall Festival.</p><p>  Join us for a fun-filled day at the farm featur
 ing</p><ul><li>U-Pick pumpkins\, sweet potatoes\, apples and corn  </li><
 li>Tractor hayrides  </li><li>Barn animal meet-and-greets  </li><li>Child
 ren's activities  </li><li>Face painting  </li><li>Pedal tractors  </li><
 li>Free family photos  </li><li>An organic farmstand  </li><li>Local food
  vendors  </li></ul><p>  and more!</p><p>  Admission is $5 per person age
 s 2 and up. The event is <strong>cashless</strong>\, and tickets can be p
 urchased in advance or at the gate. Guests are encouraged to bring their 
 own wagon for U-Pick activities. Please note that <strong>pets are not pe
 rmitted</strong>\, with the exception of service animals.</p><p><strong><
 a href="https://shonefarm.santarosa.edu/shone-farm-fall-festival" target=
 "_blank" rel="noopener">For more information and tickets\, visit the Fall
  Festival website here.</a></strong></p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><em>Shone Farm
  - 7450 Steve Olson Lane\, Forestville\, CA</em></p>
