LOCATION:Burbank Outdoor Stage Area - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Indigenous Peoples' Day
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a day of Native culture\, community\, music\, dan
 cing\, food\, and celebration as we honor Indigenous peoples\, our cultur
 es\, our traditions\, and our communities.Native Drumming  Native Dancers
   Speakers  Vendors &amp\; Informational Booths  Food  Community &amp\; C
 onnection    Come learn\, connect\, celebrate\, and experience the beauty
  and strength of Indigenous cultures and communities right here at SRJC. 
  Everyone is welcome! Bring your family\, friends\, classmates\, coworker
 s\, and relatives and come spend the day with us.SRJC 2026 Indigenous Peo
 ples' Day flyer. (https://www.instagram.com/p/DdaFt9fv2-s/)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Join us for a day of Native culture\, c
 ommunity\, music\, dancing\, food\, and celebration as we honor Indigenou
 s peoples\, our cultures\, our traditions\, and our communities.</p><ul><
 li>Native Drumming  </li><li>Native Dancers  </li><li>Speakers  </li><li>
 Vendors &amp\; Informational Booths  </li><li>Food  </li><li>Community &a
 mp\; Connection  </li></ul><p>  Come learn\, connect\, celebrate\, and ex
 perience the beauty and strength of Indigenous cultures and communities r
 ight here at SRJC.</p><p>  Everyone is welcome! Bring your family\, frien
 ds\, classmates\, coworkers\, and relatives and come spend the day with u
 s.</p><p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DdaFt9fv2-s/" target="_blan
 k" rel="noopener">SRJC 2026 Indigenous Peoples' Day flyer.</a></p>
