SUMMARY:Sistah 2 Sistah
DESCRIPTION:Sistah 2 Sistah is a welcoming space for Black girls and youn
 g women to connect\, uplift\, and empower one another.  Through sisterhoo
 d\, conversation\, wellness\, education\, leadership\, and creative exper
 iences\, students can build meaningful relationships while growing person
 ally and academically.  Topics and activities may include:Sisterhood &amp
 \; community  Self-love and confidence  Academic &amp\; career success  W
 ellness and life skills  Leadership and personal growth  Cultural identit
 y and self-discovery  For more information\, visit the Sawubona BLOC webs
 ite. (https://bloc.santarosa.edu/august-2026)  The Sawubona BLOC is locat
 ed in Pioneer Hall\, Room 360 (next to the bookstore) on the Santa Rosa C
 ampus.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Sistah 2 Sistah is a welcoming space fo
 r Black girls and young women to connect\, uplift\, and empower one anoth
 er.</p><p>  Through sisterhood\, conversation\, wellness\, education\, le
 adership\, and creative experiences\, students can build meaningful relat
 ionships while growing personally and academically.</p><p>  Topics and ac
 tivities may include:</p><ul><li>Sisterhood &amp\; community  </li><li>Se
 lf-love and confidence  </li><li>Academic &amp\; career success  </li><li
 >Wellness and life skills  </li><li>Leadership and personal growth  </li>
 <li>Cultural identity and self-discovery  </li></ul><p><a href="https://b
 loc.santarosa.edu/august-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more in
 formation\, visit the Sawubona BLOC website.</a></p><p>  The Sawubona BLO
 C is located in Pioneer Hall\, Room 360 (next to the bookstore) on the Sa
 nta Rosa Campus.</p>
