SUMMARY:From SRJC Student to CEO
DESCRIPTION:Matt will talk about his educational journey\, his experience
  starting and growing a business\, and the opportunities and challenges h
 e has encountered along the way. Whether you're interested in business\, 
 sustainability\, engineering\, economics\, or simply hearing how an SRJC 
 student built a successful career\, you'll find something valuable in his
  story.  Open to all students and community members.SRJC Business &amp\; 
 Economics Club Website (https://sites.google.com/bearcubs.santarosa.edu/s
 rjcbusinesandseconomicsclub/home)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Matt will talk about his educational jo
 urney\, his experience starting and growing a business\, and the opportun
 ities and challenges he has encountered along the way. Whether you're int
 erested in business\, sustainability\, engineering\, economics\, or simpl
 y hearing how an SRJC student built a successful career\, you'll find som
 ething valuable in his story.</p><p>  Open to all students and community 
 members.</p><p><a href="https://sites.google.com/bearcubs.santarosa.edu/s
 rjcbusinesandseconomicsclub/home" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SRJC Bus
 iness &amp\; Economics Club Website</a></p>
