SUMMARY:Brother 2 Brother
DESCRIPTION:Brother 2 Brother provides a space for men of color to connec
 t\, grow\, and support one another.  The program focuses on building brot
 herhood while creating opportunities for academic\, personal\, and profes
 sional development.  Topics may include:Academic success and study strate
 gies  Brotherhood &amp\; community  Personal development  Mental health &
 amp\; wellness  Career and life skills  Leadership and mentorship  For mo
 re information\, visit the Sawubona BLOC website. (https://bloc.santarosa
 .edu/august-2026)  The Sawubona BLOC is located in Pioneer Hall\, Room 36
 0 (next to the bookstore) on the Santa Rosa Campus.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Brother 2 Brother provides a space for 
 men of color to connect\, grow\, and support one another.</p><p>  The pro
 gram focuses on building brotherhood while creating opportunities for aca
 demic\, personal\, and professional development.</p><p>  Topics may inclu
 de:</p><ul><li>Academic success and study strategies  </li><li>Brotherhoo
 d &amp\; community  </li><li>Personal development  </li><li>Mental health
  &amp\; wellness  </li><li>Career and life skills  </li><li>Leadership an
 d mentorship  </li></ul><p><a href="https://bloc.santarosa.edu/august-202
 6" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information\, visit the Sawubo
 na BLOC website.</a></p><p>  The Sawubona BLOC is located in Pioneer Hall
 \, Room 360 (next to the bookstore) on the Santa Rosa Campus.</p>
