DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T160000
LOCATION:Student Activity Center - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Thy Neighbor - Community Movie Screening
DESCRIPTION:This documentary follows Sonoma County's unhoused population 
 and one of the largest homeless camps in Northern California that resided
  on the Joe Rodota Trail.  Award winning filmmaker Eliza Hemenway will be
  showing the film at two Sonoma County locations prior to its showing at 
 the United Nations Associated Film Festival. One of these showings will b
 e here at our beloved Santa Rosa Junior College and sponsored by the Stud
 ents for Recovery Club and Homeless Action!&#160\;Thy Neighbor: Community
  Screening Tickets - Eventbrite (https://www.eventbrite.com/e/thy-neighbo
 r-community-screening-tickets-1999930119825)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  This documentary follows Sonoma County'
 s unhoused population and one of the largest homeless camps in Northern C
 alifornia that resided on the Joe Rodota Trail.</p><p>  Award winning fil
 mmaker Eliza Hemenway will be showing the film at two Sonoma County locat
 ions prior to its showing at the United Nations Associated Film Festival.
  One of these showings will be here at our beloved Santa Rosa Junior Coll
 ege and sponsored by the Students for Recovery Club and Homeless Action!&
 #160\;</p><p><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/thy-neighbor-community
 -screening-tickets-1999930119825">Thy Neighbor: Community Screening Ticke
 ts - Eventbrite</a></p>
