DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T100000
LOCATION:Online
SUMMARY:Centering Trust: Building Mental Health Access for Undocumented S
 tudents
DESCRIPTION:Undocumented students face significant mental health needs ye
 t remain underserved due to immigration-related barriers and gaps in how 
 institutions provide support. Research from Immigrants Rising's mental he
 alth programs reveals that trust – at both the institutional and interp
 ersonal levels – is a critical missing condition. This session presents
  findings from our research\, identifies best practices\, and offers conc
 rete\, adaptable models for collaboration among campus and community stak
 eholders. Participants will leave with practical next steps.  Viewing par
 ty at PAU Center - Bertolini 3rd Floor\, #4832Registration though Zoom. (
 https://foundationccc-org.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_iIn25KloTQ-VzVnIDjF
 bZQ#/registration)For more information about Undocumented Student Success
  Week\, visit the Undocu · Immigrant · Dream Center website. (https://d
 ream.santarosa.edu/workshops-events-2026-2027)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Undocumented students face significant 
 mental health needs yet remain underserved due to immigration-related bar
 riers and gaps in how institutions provide support. Research from Immigra
 nts Rising's mental health programs reveals that trust – at both the in
 stitutional and interpersonal levels – is a critical missing condition.
  This session presents findings from our research\, identifies best pract
 ices\, and offers concrete\, adaptable models for collaboration among cam
 pus and community stakeholders. Participants will leave with practical ne
 xt steps.</p><p>  Viewing party at PAU Center - Bertolini 3rd Floor\, #48
 32</p><p><strong><a href="https://foundationccc-org.zoom.us/webinar/regis
 ter/WN_iIn25KloTQ-VzVnIDjFbZQ#/registration" target="_blank" rel="noopene
 r">Registration though Zoom.</a></strong></p><p><a href="https://dream.sa
 ntarosa.edu/workshops-events-2026-2027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fo
 r more information about Undocumented Student Success Week\, visit the Un
 docu · Immigrant · Dream Center website.</a></p>
