DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261021T100000
LOCATION:Online
SUMMARY:More Than a Starting Point: The Power of Noncredit Education for 
 Undocumented Students
DESCRIPTION:Noncredit education can provide an important pathway for undo
 cumented and immigration impacted students to access higher education\, b
 uild skills\, and advance toward their academic and career goals. This we
 binar will highlight promising practices for creating welcoming and inclu
 sive noncredit programs\, supporting students as they navigate AB 540 eli
 gibility\, strengthening partnerships across campus and community\, and b
 uilding pathways from noncredit to credit programs. Presenters will share
  practical strategies and lessons from the field that colleges can adapt 
 to strengthen access\, belonging\, retention\, and student success.  View
 ing party at PAU Center - Bertolini 3rd Floor\, #4832Registration though 
 Zoom. (https://foundationccc-org.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_j5g13fG9SDyN
 4njwBP8EUg#/registration)For more information about Undocumented Student 
 Success Week\, visit the Undocu · Immigrant · Dream Center website. (ht
 tps://dream.santarosa.edu/workshops-events-2026-2027)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Noncredit education can provide an impo
 rtant pathway for undocumented and immigration impacted students to acces
 s higher education\, build skills\, and advance toward their academic and
  career goals. This webinar will highlight promising practices for creati
 ng welcoming and inclusive noncredit programs\, supporting students as th
 ey navigate AB 540 eligibility\, strengthening partnerships across campus
  and community\, and building pathways from noncredit to credit programs.
  Presenters will share practical strategies and lessons from the field th
 at colleges can adapt to strengthen access\, belonging\, retention\, and 
 student success.</p><p>  Viewing party at PAU Center - Bertolini 3rd Floo
 r\, #4832</p><p><strong><a href="https://foundationccc-org.zoom.us/webina
 r/register/WN_j5g13fG9SDyN4njwBP8EUg#/registration" target="_blank" rel="
 noopener">Registration though Zoom.</a></strong></p><p><a href="https://d
 ream.santarosa.edu/workshops-events-2026-2027" target="_blank" rel="noope
 ner">For more information about Undocumented Student Success Week\, visit
  the Undocu · Immigrant · Dream Center website.</a></p>
