 first-generation student or not\, building your support network and learn
 ing how to better navigate your college experience is essential to reachi
 ng your academic goals. Free lunch provided.Workshop Schedule at SRJC Pet
 aluma (https://petaluma.santarosa.edu/workshop-schedule)
