LOCATION:Online
SUMMARY:Behind the Consultation: A Conversation with Immigration Legal Se
 rvices Providers
DESCRIPTION:What happens when a student connects with an immigration lega
 l services provider? Join a panel of legal services professionals for a c
 onversation that demystifies the process and helps students and practitio
 ners better understand what to expect before\, during\, and after a legal
  consultation. Our panelists will share how students can prepare for an a
 ppointment\, what a consultation may look like\, what happens after the m
 eeting\, and how legal services teams support students in understanding t
 heir options and next steps. The conversation will also highlight the fre
 e and confidential immigration legal services available to California Com
 munity College students and how practitioners can help connect students t
 o these important resources.  Viewing party at PAU Center - Bertolini 3rd
  Floor\, #4832Registration though Zoom. (https://foundationccc-org.zoom.u
 s/webinar/register/WN_fVbuEsxwSVKM8lX4Ca26tw#/registration)For more infor
 mation about Undocumented Student Success Week\, visit the Undocu · Immi
 grant · Dream Center website. (https://dream.santarosa.edu/workshops-eve
 nts-2026-2027)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  What happens when a student connects wi
 th an immigration legal services provider? Join a panel of legal services
  professionals for a conversation that demystifies the process and helps 
 students and practitioners better understand what to expect before\, duri
 ng\, and after a legal consultation. Our panelists will share how student
 s can prepare for an appointment\, what a consultation may look like\, wh
 at happens after the meeting\, and how legal services teams support stude
 nts in understanding their options and next steps. The conversation will 
 also highlight the free and confidential immigration legal services avail
 able to California Community College students and how practitioners can h
 elp connect students to these important resources.</p><p>  Viewing party 
 at PAU Center - Bertolini 3rd Floor\, #4832</p><p><strong><a href="https:
 //foundationccc-org.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_fVbuEsxwSVKM8lX4Ca26tw#/r
 egistration" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Registration though Zoom.</a>
 </strong></p><p><a href="https://dream.santarosa.edu/workshops-events-202
 6-2027" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information about Undocum
 ented Student Success Week\, visit the Undocu · Immigrant · Dream Cente
 r website.</a></p>
