LOCATION:Bertolini Quad - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Green Living Fair
DESCRIPTION:The Green Living Fair will feature a variety of activities an
 d resources\, including:A garment mending bar for simple clothing repairs
   A clothing swap to give gently used clothing a new home  Bicycle repair
  assistance  Small appliance repair  Freecycle giveaways featuring items 
 available for reuse  Upcycled crafts and other creative reuse activities 
  Information from local organizations and SRJC clubs about sustainable li
 ving    Community members are encouraged to bring a garment\, bicycle\, s
 mall appliance\, and/or electronic item that needs repair. Those planning
  to bring an item for mending are encouraged to sign up in advance.For mo
 re information and to sign up for repair services\, visit the Sustainable
  SRJC website. (https://sustainability.santarosa.edu/)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Green Living Fair will feature a va
 riety of activities and resources\, including:</p><ul><li>A garment mendi
 ng bar for simple clothing repairs  </li><li>A clothing swap to give gent
 ly used clothing a new home  </li><li>Bicycle repair assistance  </li><li
 >Small appliance repair  </li><li>Freecycle giveaways featuring items ava
 ilable for reuse  </li><li>Upcycled crafts and other creative reuse activ
 ities  </li><li>Information from local organizations and SRJC clubs about
  sustainable living  </li></ul><p>  Community members are encouraged to b
 ring a garment\, bicycle\, small appliance\, and/or electronic item that 
 needs repair. Those planning to bring an item for mending are encouraged 
 to sign up in advance.</p><p><a href="https://sustainability.santarosa.ed
 u/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information and to sign up fo
 r repair services\, visit the Sustainable SRJC website.</a></p>
