X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261113T160000
LOCATION:Student Health Services\, Bertolini Student Center - Santa Rosa 
 Campus
SUMMARY:Mental Health First Aid
DESCRIPTION:The Mental Health First Aid (https://mentalhealthfirstaid.org
 /) program teaches how to identify\, understand and respond to signs of m
 ental illnesses and substance use disorders. This in-depth training provi
 des skills needed to reach out and provide initial help and support to an
 yone who may be developing a mental health or substance use problem or ex
 periencing a crisis.To register visit the Student Health Services website
 . (https://shs.santarosa.edu/11-13-26-mhfa)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The <a href="https://mentalhealthfirsta
 id.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mental Health First Aid</a> progr
 am teaches how to identify\, understand and respond to signs of mental il
 lnesses and substance use disorders. This in-depth training provides skil
 ls needed to reach out and provide initial help and support to anyone who
  may be developing a mental health or substance use problem or experienci
 ng a crisis.</p><p><a href="https://shs.santarosa.edu/11-13-26-mhfa" targ
