 ect with resources.</p><p>  Get prepped for finals by finding out what ot
 her departments have to offer and building your support team on campus.</
 p><p><a href="https://petaluma.santarosa.edu/workshop-schedule" target="_
 blank" rel="noopener">For more information\, visit our <em>Petaluma</em><
 em>Student Success Events &amp\; Workshops</em> website here.</a></p><p> 
  &#160\;</p><p>  SRJC Petaluma - 680 Sonoma Mountain Pkwy\, Petaluma\, CA
  94954</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p>  —–</p><p>  Finals Prep Day 2<br />  We
 dnesday\, December 2nd\, 11:30am-1:00pm<br />  Café Patio</p>
