BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270219T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270219T203000
LOCATION:Newman Auditorium (Emeritus Hall) - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Trio con Brio Copenhagen - SRJC's Chamber Concert Series
DESCRIPTION:The Trio is a fusion of two overlapping "musical pairs": two 
 sisters\, violinist Soo-Jin Hong and cellist Soo-Kyung Hong are from Sout
 h Korea\; pianist Jens Elvekjaer\, Soo-Kyung's spouse\, is from Denmark. 
 Based in Copenhagen\, the Trio is recognized for its exceptional musician
 ship\, fresh approach to the core repertoire\, and adventurous programmin
 g.  &#160\;For more information and tickets\, visit SRJC's Chamber Concer
 t Series website. (https://chamberconcerts.santarosa.edu/)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Trio is a fusion of two overlapping
  "musical pairs": two sisters\, violinist Soo-Jin Hong and cellist Soo-Ky
 ung Hong are from South Korea\; pianist Jens Elvekjaer\, Soo-Kyung's spou
 se\, is from Denmark. Based in Copenhagen\, the Trio is recognized for it
 s exceptional musicianship\, fresh approach to the core repertoire\, and 
 adventurous programming.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><a href="https://chamberco
 ncerts.santarosa.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more informatio
 n and tickets\, visit SRJC's Chamber Concert Series website.</a></p>
