X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270226T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270226T203000
LOCATION:Burbank Auditorium\, Studio Theatre - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Blithe Spirit - SRJC Theatre Arts
DESCRIPTION:Blithe Spirit is a witty 1941 Noël Coward comedy about Charl
 es Condomine. Charles\, a novelist\, is haunted by his temperamental firs
 t wife\, Elvira\, after a séance goes wrong. Elvira disrupts Charles's m
 arriage to his second wife\, Ruth\, resulting in paranormal antics.  &#16
 0\;Ticketing:Visit SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for details and ticke
 ts. (https://srjc.universitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=35)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><em>Blithe Spirit</em> is a witty 1941 No
 ël Coward comedy about Charles Condomine. Charles\, a novelist\, is haun
 ted by his temperamental first wife\, Elvira\, after a séance goes wrong
 . Elvira disrupts Charles's marriage to his second wife\, Ruth\, resultin
 g in paranormal antics.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><strong>Ticketing:</strong>
 <a href="https://srjc.universitytickets.com/w/event.aspx?SeriesID=35" tar
 get="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit SRJC's Theatre Arts tickets page for de
 tails and tickets.</a></p>
